=0A<p=20class=3DMsoToc1>Bibliography<span=20style=3D"mso-tab-count:1=20dott=
ed">.=20</span><span=20style=3D"mso-element:field-begin"></span>=20PAGEREF=20=
_15575e4b-aa58-5c77-8b1e-b8a452ca176b=20\h=20<span=20style=3D"mso-element:f=
ield-separator"></span><span=20style=3D"mso-element:field-end"></span></p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-special-character=
:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DForewordTitl=
e>Foreword</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>ISO=20(the=20International=20Or=
ganization=20for=20Standardization)=20and=20IEC=20(the=20International=20El=
ectrotechnical=20Commission)=20form=20the=20specialized=20system=20for=20wo=
rldwide=20standardization.=20National=20bodies=20that=20are=20members=20of=20=
ISO=20or=20IEC=20participate=20in=20the=20development=20of=20International=20=
Standards=20through=20technical=20committees=20established=20by=20the=20res=
pective=20organization=20to=20deal=20with=20particular=20fields=20of=20tech=
nical=20activity.=20ISO=20and=20IEC=20technical=20committees=20collaborate=20=
in=20fields=20of=20mutual=20interest.=20Other=20international=20organizatio=
ns,=20governmental=20and=20non-governmental,=20in=20liaison=20with=20ISO=20=
and=20IEC,=20also=20take=20part=20in=20the=20work.=20In=20the=20field=20of=20=
information=20technology,=20ISO=20and=20IEC=20have=20established=20a=20join=
t=20technical=20committee,=20ISO/IEC=20JTC=201.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForeword=
Text>International=20Standards=20are=20drafted=20in=20accordance=20with=20t=
he=20rules=20given=20in=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=202.</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DForewordText>The=20main=20task=20of=20the=20joint=20technical=20com=
mittee=20is=20to=20prepare=20International=20Standards.=20Draft=20Internati=
onal=20Standards=20adopted=20by=20the=20joint=20technical=20committee=20are=
=20circulated=20to=20national=20bodies=20for=20voting.=20Publication=20as=20=
an=20International=20Standard=20requires=20approval=20by=20at=20least=2075=20=
%=20of=20the=20national=20bodies=20casting=20a=20vote.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DF=
orewordText>In=20exceptional=20circumstances,=20when=20the=20joint=20techni=
cal=20committee=20has=20collected=20data=20of=20a=20different=20kind=20from=
=20that=20which=20is=20normally=20published=20as=20an=20International=20Sta=
ndard=20(=E2=80=9Cstate=20of=20the=20art=E2=80=9D,=20for=20example),=20it=20=
may=20decide=20to=20publish=20a=20Technical=20Report.=20A=20Technical=20Rep=
ort=20is=20entirely=20informative=20in=20nature=20and=20shall=20be=20subjec=
t=20to=20review=20every=20five=20years=20in=20the=20same=20manner=20as=20an=
=20International=20Standard.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Attention=20is=
=20drawn=20to=20the=20possibility=20that=20some=20of=20the=20elements=20of=20=
this=20document=20may=20be=20the=20subject=20of=20patent=20rights.=20ISO=20=
and=20IEC=20shall=20not=20be=20held=20responsible=20for=20identifying=20any=
=20or=20all=20such=20patent=20rights.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>ISO/I=
EC=20TR=2029166=20was=20prepared=20by=20Joint=20Technical=20Committee=20ISO=
/IEC=20JTC=201,=20Information=20technology,=20Subcommittee=20SC=2034,=20Doc=
ument=20description=20and=20processing=20languages.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoN=
ormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-special-character:line-break;page-=
break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=3DIntroTitle>Introduction</h1>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>OASIS=20Open=20Document=20Format=20ODF=201.0=20(<a=20=
href=3D"#iso-iec_26300">ISO/IEC=C2=A026300:2006</a>)=20and=20Office=20Open=20=
XML=20(ISO/IEC=2029500)=20are=20both=20open=20document=20formats=20for=20sa=
ving=20and=20exchanging=20word=20processing=20documents,=20spreadsheets=20a=
nd=20presentations.=20Both=20formats=20are=20XML=20based=20but=20differ=20i=
n=20design=20and=20scope.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>The=20following=20ab=
breviations=20are=20used=20throughout=20this=20Technical=20Report:</p>=0A<p=
=20class=3DListContinue1>ODF,=20which=20stands=20for=20OpenDocument=20Forma=
t=20(<a=20href=3D"#iso-iec_26300">ISO/IEC=C2=A026300:2006</a>);</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DListContinue1>OOXML,=20which=20stands=20for=20Office=20Open=20XML=20=
(ISO/IEC=2029500:2008).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>ISO/IEC=2029500=20is=20=
structured=20into=20four=20parts,=20each=20of=20which=20contains=20normativ=
e=20as=20well=20as=20informative=20material:=20Fundamentals=20and=20Markup=20=
Language=20Reference,=20Open=20Packaging=20Conventions,=20Markup=20Compatib=
ility=20and=20Extensibility,=20and=20Transitional=20Migration=20Features.</=
p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>At=20the=20time=20of=20writing=20(June=202011)=20=
the=20following=20corrigenda=20and=20amendments=20have=20been=20published:<=
/p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>ISO/IEC=2029500-1:2008/Cor.1:2010,=20ISO/I=
EC=2029500-2:2008/Cor.1:2010,=20ISO/IEC=2029500-3:2008/Cor.1:2010=20and=20I=
SO/IEC=2029500-4:2008/Cor.1:2010,=20containing=20minor=20technical=20correc=
tions=20and=20editorial=20modifications;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>I=
SO/IEC=2029500-1:2008/Amd.1:2010=20and=20ISO/IEC=2029500-4:2008/Amd.1:2010,=
=20containing=20namespace=20changes=20and=20modifications=20concerning=20th=
e=20usage=20of=20percentage=20(%)=20values;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue=
1>ISO/IEC=2029500:2011=20(ECMA=20376=203rd=20edition)=20as=20a=20consolidat=
ed=20version=20of=20OOXML=20containing=20the=20above-mentioned=20corrigenda=
=20and=20amendments;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>ISO/IEC=2026300:2006/=
Cor.1:2010,=20containing=20editorial=20modifications;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DLi=
stContinue1>ISO/IEC=2026300:2006/Cor.2:2011,=20fixing=20editorial=20errors.=
</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>In=20addition,=20the=20following=20Amendments=
=20are=20under=20preparation:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>Amendment=20=
1=20to=20ISO/IEC=2029500-1:2011=20and=20Amendment=201=20to=20ISO/IEC=202950=
0-4:2011=20about=20ISO=208601=20dates;</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>Ame=
ndment=201=20to=20ISO/IEC=2026300:2006=20introducing=20ODF=201.1.</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A=0A</div>=0A=0A<br=20clear=3D"all=
"=20class=3D"section"=20/>=0A=0A<div=20class=3D>=0A=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitl=
e1>Information=20technology=20=E2=80=94=20Document=20description=20and=20pr=
ocessing=20languages=E2=80=89=E2=80=94=E2=80=89Guidelines=20for=20translati=
on=20between=20ISO/IEC=2026300=20and=20ISO/IEC=2029500=20document=20formats=
</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Scope</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20=
Technical=20Report=20provides=20guidelines=20for=20translation=20between=20=
ISO/IEC=2026300=20and=20ISO/IEC=2029500=20document=20formats.=20It=20starts=
=20by=20studying=20common=20use=20cases=20to=20identify=20how=20the=20most=20=
important=20functionalities=20of=20one=20document=20format=20can=20be=20rep=
resented=20in=20the=20other=20format.=20This=20is=20followed=20by=20a=20tho=
rough=20review=20of=20the=20concepts,=20architectures=20and=20various=20fea=
tures=20of=20the=20two=20document=20formats=20in=20order=20to=20provide=20a=
=20good=20understanding=20of=20the=20commonalities=20and=20differences.=20I=
t=20is=20expected=20that=20functionalities=20will=20be=20able=20to=20be=20t=
ranslated=20with=20different=20degrees=20of=20fidelity=20to=20the=20other=20=
format.=20As=20an=20illustrative=20sample=20of=20this=20functionality,=20de=
tailed=20information=20is=20provided=20on=20the=20extent=20to=20which=20tho=
se=20functionalities=20can=20be=20translated.=20This=20Technical=20Report=20=
is=20a=20necessary=20step=20to=20the=20goal=20of=20helping=20achieve=20inte=
roperability=20and=20harmonization=20between=20the=20two=20formats.</p>=0A<=
h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Normative=20references</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNorm=
al>The=20following=20documents=20are=20referred=20to=20in=20the=20text=20in=
