ames=20of=20scripts</i></span>.</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Terms=20and=
=20definitions</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>For=20the=20purposes=20of=20th=
is=20document,=20the=20following=20terms=20and=20definitions=20apply.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>ISO=20and=20IEC=20maintain=20terminology=20databases=
=20for=20use=20in=20standardization=20at=20the=20following=20addresses:</p>=
=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>ISO=20Online=20browsing=20platform:=20availab=
le=20at=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>IEC=20Electropedia:=20available=
=20at=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.1</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>transla=
tion=20type</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>methods=20used=20when=20trans=
lating=20between=20ODF=20and=20OOXML=20documents</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>No=
te=201=20to=20entry:=20This=20Technical=20Report=20distinguishes=20four=20t=
ranslation=20types:=20*=20one=20way=20ODF=20to=20OOXML=20translation;=20*=20=
one=20way=20OOXML=20to=20ODF=20translation;=20*=20round=20trip=20ODF=20to=20=
OOXML=20to=20ODF=20translation;=20*=20round=20trip=20OOXML=20to=20ODF=20to=20=
OOXML=20translation.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.2</p>=0A<p=20class=3DT=
erms><b>translation=20fidelity</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>quality=20=
of=20a=20translation=20process=20between=20the=20ODF=20and=20OOXML=20docume=
nt=20formats</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20Translation=20=
fidelity=20depends=20on=20document=20properties.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote=
>Note=202=20to=20entry:=20Translation=20fidelity=20cannot=20be=20measured=20=
in=20an=20absolute=20manner;=20it=20depends=20on=20the=20intentions=20of=20=
the=20document=E2=80=99s=20authors.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.3</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DTerms><b>document=20property</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition=
>description=20of=20different=20yet=20independent=20dimensions=20within=20t=
he=20specification=20of=20a=20document</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20t=
o=20entry:=20As=20defined=20in=204.2=20this=20Technical=20Report=20distingu=
ishes=20the=20following=20document=20properties:=20*=20presentation=20instr=
uctions;=20*=20content;=20*=20dynamic=20content;=20*=20meta=20data;=20*=20a=
nnotations=20and=20security;=20*=20document=20parts.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
Note>Note=202=20to=20entry:=20Document=20properties=20are=20implemented=20u=
sing=20document=20features.=20</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>General</h1>=
=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.4.1</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>access</b></p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DDefinition>right,=20opportunity,=20means=20of=20finding,=20usi=
ng=20or=20retrieving=20information</p>=0A<p=20class=3DSource>[SOURCE:=20<a=20=
href=3D"#iso15489_1">ISO=C2=A015489-1:2016,=203.1</a>]</p>=0A<p=20class=3DT=
ermNum>3.4.2</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>asset</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefin=
ition>anything=20that=20has=20value=20to=20the=20organization</p>=0A<p=20cl=
ass=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20There=20can=20be=20many=20types=20of=20=
assets,=20including:=20=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DSource>[SOURCE:=20<a=20href=3D=
"#iso27000">ISO/IEC=C2=A027000:2009,=202.3</a>]</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>=
3.4.3</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>record(s)</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefiniti=
on>information=20created,=20received=20and=20maintained=20as=20evidence=20a=
nd=20as=20an=20=20by=20an=20organization=20or=20person,=20in=20pursuit=20of=
=20legal=20obligations=20or=20in=20the=20transaction=20of=20business</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20The=20viewpoint=20defined=20in=20=
this=20document=20is=20intended=20to=20be=20useful=20in=20any=20enterprise=20=
architecture=20scenario,=20and=20intended=20to=20prevent=20conflicting=20me=
anings=20in=20multiple=20viewpoints.=20The=20term=20used=20in=20the=20Archi=
Mate=20modelling=20of=20this=20viewpoint=20is=20=E2=80=9Cbusiness=20record=E2=
=80=9D.=20In=20this=20document=20the=20term=20=E2=80=9Cbusiness=20record=E2=
=80=9D=20has=20the=20same=20definition=20as=20the=20established=20definitio=
n=20for=20=E2=80=9Crecord=E2=80=9D=20in=20the=20records=20management=20doma=
in.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DSource>[SOURCE:=20<a=20href=3D"#iso15489_1">ISO=C2=
=A015489-1:2016,=203.14</a>]</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.4.4</p>=0A<p=20cl=
ass=3DTerms><b>records=20system</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>informati=
on=20system=20which=20captures,=20manages=20and=20provides=20=20to=20=20thr=
ough=20time</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20In=20the=20con=
